  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to imbue a specifically crafted weapon, armor, or article of clothing with the power of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>. Imbuing the item requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, the wearer of such an item can open themselves to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>, transferring one of their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> into the item. You can then use a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to spend a stored <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> at any later time, even in the same round that you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> of your own.<br><br>You can attune only one item per 24 hours, the item functions only for you, and a given item can only store one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> at a time. You cannot wear more than one attuned item at a time, and you can spend only up to a maximum of two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> in a round (one of your own, plus one from an imbued item).",
